## Maintenance

- **Keep commands current**: Update when project patterns or tools change
- **Remove obsolete commands**: Delete commands that are no longer relevant
- **Consolidate when needed**: Merge similar commands to avoid duplication
- **Test commands**: Verify commands work as intended when creating or updating